    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🚀 How It Works\n\n• Starts when a new sales call is booked (or triggered manually during testing).\n• Retrieves prospect information from Google Sheets and performs an automated deep-dive into their company, technology stack, and other key data via Tavily.\n• Automatically finds the most relevant products or solutions from your list and updates the sheet accordingly.\n• Crafts personalized email confirmations (subject line + body) and SMS messages, leveraging customer testimonials for extra impact.\n• Saves all outreach content directly into your Google Sheet for easy access and follow-up.\n\n⏱️ Total setup time: ~10–15 minutes\n👉 All nodes come pre-configured—just adjust the credentials and input fields as needed. Helpful notes (like prompt customization tips) are available in sticky notes inside the workflow.",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "5828568a-a319-4b37-b0b6-c72c8c411b66",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        320,
        624
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "###  ⚙️ Outreach Genie Setup: Automate Prospect Research & Tailored Outreach for Sales Calls\n\n\n🚀 How to Get Started:\n\nSet Up Your Google Sheets\n\nConnect your Google account via OAuth2 for nodes like \"Review Calls\", \"Product List\", \"Testimonials Tool\", \"Update Sheet\", and \"Update Sheets 2\".\n\nMake a copy of this sample Google Sheet (ID: 1u3WMJwYGwZewW1IztY8dfbEf5yBQxVh8oH7LQp4rAk4) to your Google Drive.\n\nUpdate all documentId references in the Google Sheets nodes with your copy’s ID.\n\nMake sure your sheet includes tabs named \"Meeting Data\", \"Products\", and \"Success Stories\" filled with your info.\n⏱️ Estimated time: ~5 minutes\n\nAdd Your OpenAI API Key\n\nHead over to OpenAI Platform\n and generate an API key.\n\nInsert your key in the credentials fields for both \"OpenAI Chat Model\" nodes.\n⏱️ Estimated time: ~2 minutes\n\nConfigure Tavily Integration\n\nSign up at Tavily\n and get your API key.\n\nIn the \"Tavily\" node, replace the sample api_key value in the JSON body with your own key.\n⏱️ Estimated time: ~3 minutes",
        "height": 768,
        "width": 464,
        "color": 4
      },
